Description:
The filter lists the blocking engine uses for ads (EasyList) and trackers
(EasyPrivacy), by The EasyList authors (https://easylist.to/). Dual-licensed:
GNU General Public License version 3 or later, or Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported, at the user's choice.

Local Modifications:
None. tools/filter_lists.py fetches them unmodified and records each list's
source, version and sha256 in VERSIONS.json. They ship as data files beside
the browser, never compiled into it (docs/licensing.md).
